{
  "name": "GD·02 Listen",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## GD·02 Listen (Boss 5 · D4, from 5.3)\nEvery 15 min: Facebook Page comments + Instagram comments + web mentions (Talkwalker Alerts RSS) → one shape → new items only (item_id unique) → AI labels → hard rules in CODE → 'now' alerts at once.\nStorm rule (curveball 1): 10+ negative mentions on one topic in an hour → posting AND outreach paused, Tolu alerted. Resume only when Tolu says.\n18:00: summary of 'today' items. Monday 08:00: report with counts and three fixes quoting negative comments.\n\nTable: mentions(item_id pk, source, link, posted_at, text, sentiment, topic, urgent, intent, confidence, level, alerted, created_at).\n**Credentials:** Facebook Graph API (page token), Postgres, OpenAI, Telegram, Gmail.\n**Replace:** YOUR_PAGE_ID, YOUR_IG_USER_ID, YOUR_TALKWALKER_RSS_URL, YOUR_MODEL, YOUR_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID, tolu@harvestlane.example.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 440
      },
      "id": "89ebfe67-6a93-4c21-9ff0-5df726595a89",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
